  title: Anger
  description: Father loved pointing out how useless I was to the family compared
    to my brother. In reality, \n it often felt like I was the only one actually
    working for us. Meanwhile, the golden son was \n studying abroad, living his
    best life, leaving me, once again, forevermore in his shadow.
